## Chunked CURL

1. Basic valid chunked
printf '4\r\nWiki\r\n5\r\npedia\r\n0\r\n\r\n' | curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/ --http1.1 -H "Transfer-Encoding: chunked" --data-binary @-
2. Single chunk
printf 'B\r\nHello World\r\n0\r\n\r\n' | curl -X POST http://localhost:8080 -H "Transfer-Encoding: chunked" --data-binary @-
3. Multiple small chunks
printf '1\r\na\r\n1\r\nb\r\n1\r\nc\r\n0\r\n\r\n' | curl -X POST http://localhost:8080 -H "Transfer-Encoding: chunked" --data-binary @-
4. Chunk extensions
printf '5;ext=value\r\nHello\r\n0\r\n\r\n' | curl -X POST http://localhost:8080 -H "Transfer-Encoding: chunked" --data-binary @-
5. Uppercase hex size
printf 'A\r\n0123456789\r\n0\r\n\r\n' | curl -X POST http://localhost:8080 -H "Transfer-Encoding: chunked" --data-binary @-
6. Lowercase hex size
printf 'a\r\n0123456789\r\n0\r\n\r\n' | curl -X POST http://localhost:8080 -H "Transfer-Encoding: chunked" --data-binary @-
7. Empty body (just terminator)
printf '0\r\n\r\n' | curl -X POST http://localhost:8080 -H "Transfer-Encoding: chunked" --data-binary @-
8. Chunk with CRLF inside data
printf '6\r\nhi\r\nok\r\n0\r\n\r\n' | curl -X POST http://localhost:8080 -H "Transfer-Encoding: chunked" --data-binary @-
9. Trailers present
printf '5\r\nHello\r\n0\r\nX-Test: yes\r\n\r\n' | curl -X POST http://localhost:8080 -H "Transfer-Encoding: chunked" -H "Trailer: X-Test" --data-binary @-
10. Large chunk
printf '20\r\n12345678901234567890123456789012\r\n0\r\n\r\n' | curl -X POST http://localhost:8080 -H "Transfer-Encoding: chunked" --data-binary @-
🔴 11–20: Invalid / edge cases
11. Missing final CRLF
printf '5\r\nHello\r\n0\r\n' | curl -X POST http://localhost:8080 -H "Transfer-Encoding: chunked" --data-binary @-
12. Invalid hex size
printf 'Z\r\nHello\r\n0\r\n\r\n' | curl -X POST http://localhost:8080 -H "Transfer-Encoding: chunked" --data-binary @-
13. Size smaller than data
printf '3\r\nHello\r\n0\r\n\r\n' | curl -X POST http://localhost:8080 -H "Transfer-Encoding: chunked" --data-binary @-
14. Size larger than data
printf 'A\r\nHi\r\n0\r\n\r\n' | curl -X POST http://localhost:8080 -H "Transfer-Encoding: chunked" --data-binary @-
15. Missing terminating chunk
printf '5\r\nHello\r\n' | curl -X POST http://localhost:8080 -H "Transfer-Encoding: chunked" --data-binary @-
16. Extra CRLF before chunk size
printf '\r\n5\r\nHello\r\n0\r\n\r\n' | curl -X POST http://localhost:8080 -H "Transfer-Encoding: chunked" --data-binary @-
17. Negative chunk size
printf '-5\r\nHello\r\n0\r\n\r\n' | curl -X POST http://localhost:8080 -H "Transfer-Encoding: chunked" --data-binary @-
18. Chunk size with spaces
printf '5 \r\nHello\r\n0\r\n\r\n' | curl -X POST http://localhost:8080 -H "Transfer-Encoding: chunked" --data-binary @-
19. Missing CRLF after chunk data
printf '5\r\nHello0\r\n\r\n' | curl -X POST http://localhost:8080 -H "Transfer-Encoding: chunked" --data-binary @-
20. Multiple terminating chunks
printf '5\r\nHello\r\n0\r\n\r\n0\r\n\r\n' | curl -X POST http://localhost:8080 -H "Transfer-Encoding: chunked" --data-binary @-
